<title>USA: Koss to buy back up to $5 million in stock.</title>
<headline>Koss to buy back up to $5 million in stock.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koss Corp, which makes stereophones and telecommunications headsets, said Wednesday its directors had authorized spending up to $5 million to repurchase company shares.</p>
<p>Koss has about 3.4 million shares outstanding. Its shares were off 1/2 to 9-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
